Text: PSEUDO LABELING AND NEGATIVE FEEDBACK LEARNING FOR LARGE-SCALE MULTI-LABEL DOMAIN CLASSIFICATION Joo-Kyung Kim Amazon Alexa AI ABSTRACT arXiv:2003.03728v1 [cs.CL] 8 Mar 2020 In large-scale domain classiﬁcation, an utterance can be han- dled by multiple domains with overlapped capabilities. How- ever, only a limited number of ground-truth domains are pro- vided for each training utterance in practice while knowing as many as correct target labels is helpful for improving the model performance.

